{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1402387-scion-podcast-a-rendezvous-with-destiny","id":1402387,"title":"Scion Podcast - A Rendezvous With Destiny!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-07-12T03:23:02-07:00","id":1402387,"title":"Scion Podcast - A Rendezvous With Destiny!","content":"<span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">I hope this is okay to post here - if not please let me know where to post it!</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u200b</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">A Rendezvous With Destiny is an actual-play podcast based on the Scion game system started by four perpetual GMs. Our story follows three young women in 2019 Washington DC, who\u2019ve recently discovered new-found demigod powers - as well as new-found demigod problems! Join Cleo, Elspeth and Flora as they face the horrors of the underworld, hordes of demons and (worst of all) more than one devastating hangover..</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">If you enjoy Percy Jackson, Naddpod, Dimension20, we have that fun, silly-but-serious vibe, along with an entirely LGBTQ cast! Please do take your time to give us a listen, we\u2019re 'A Rendezvous with Destiny' on Spotify, Acast, iTunes and Youtube, and '@RWD_Pod' on twitter (links below). We have just finished our first arc of ten 45-minute episodes, so there\u2019s a whole story for you to engage with before joining us for weekly updates every Thursday!<br /> <br /> If any of you guys have any feedback, praise or criticism we'd love to hear it all. Thanks!</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"